    },
    {
      "id": "claim_f50dbd174b834a7b871e2f21b60987af",
      "statement": "When streamed text diverges from the final assistant message rather than being a prefix of it, the translator emits nothing and logs a warning, because duplicating text is worse than dropping a correction and divergence means an assumption about the CLI no longer holds.",
