      "id": "claim_8bf1e7948fb146a383a3bcb91c5ec9c3",
      "statement": "Every value originating outside the agent's own code — tool inputs, tool results, permission suggestions — is coerced through jsonable() before transmission, because websocket.send_json raises on unserialisable values and the sender treats a raise as fatal to the socket.",
