      "id": "claim_cdc0c0ec41be4872ad45ba73d474a5b5",
      "statement": "jsonable() handles dataclasses, dicts, sequences and pydantic models, degrades unknown objects to repr, and guards against cycles with a depth limit of 8, on the principle that a slightly ugly frame beats a dead socket.",
